abstract: >-
  USCOO is an open-source preparation workspace for founders filing through
  their own company and immigration professionals. It models O-1A preparation
  as an evidence graph with provenance, contribution boundaries, uncertainty,
  and counsel handoff.
keywords:
  - O-1A
  - immigration technology
  - legal technology
  - evidence graph
  - founders
  - provenance
